{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a9189246d0a1218607930a32e48d48b2e19600089332da7e3ba7c1a969914f1e","ja":"ファンレターかぁ……\nそれじゃあ、読んでみるね！","zh":"是粉丝信啊……\n那我这就读读看哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5e8ab8590a290042d96dd541469baa0d044de155daafd1a5f4253a8ac5b381b6","ja":"えーっと、「響ちゃんの歌が好き、ダンスが好き、\n話し方も見た目も好き、もう全部大好き」って……。","zh":"唔，上面写着“喜欢小响的歌声，喜欢小响的舞蹈，\n喜欢小响的说话方式和外表，总之全部都最喜欢了”……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"19a70a66f844d37cb95117241f0cf61697ec31ef26df1cbe3aa617cc97f694e4","ja":"ま、まぁ！　自分はカンペキだからね！","zh":"哎、哎呀！毕竟我可是很完美的嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d50cc9d351109cc2c387c7950d1309e49998cae3151ca9adbda6bc982d3e7ac0","ja":"ボクのは……「かっこいいだけじゃなくて、\nみんなを優しく見る瞳が大好きです」、かあ……。","zh":"我收到的……是“不仅很帅气，\n我也非常喜欢你温柔注视着大家的眼眸”啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7c86df187ca82d833927732654684f95d747f8cc3df96d6bcc1876ac72c1cd3c","ja":"へへっ……こうやって褒めてもらうと、\nなんだかくすぐったいね。","zh":"嘿嘿……被你这样夸奖，\n总觉得怪不好意思的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"9dd9c00abaffbfcc3b295f0092ffd52a60796319dbf703688ad61cd4a64bfea1","ja":"うふふ♪　ファンのみなさんの思い、\nしっかり伝わっているみたいね？","zh":"呵呵♪　粉丝们的心意，\n看来都有好好传达到了呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4c38c293ed0cbeb14eea96038c71629039288bd2616039968b8d6f34c6775cd0","ja":"伝えたい思いを素直に言葉にする。\n歌詞に気持ちを乗せるのも同じではないかと。","zh":"坦率地将想要传达的心意化作言语。\n把感情寄托在歌词中，想必也是同理吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"251deaeeb675495cb1622f39f7253b9f6c4c1b14caa9da2370a4afdb808ba1cb","ja":"そっか……もしかしたらボクたち、\nちょっとカッコつけようとしてたのかもしれないね！","zh":"这样啊……说不定我们，\n之前有点在硬装帅气了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"8ec03b0a42e6e4b7093d86e850c5b077206ca759cd6a59c4ac5baf06e9770162","ja":"それなら自分は、「家族が大好きー」って\n気持ちを書いてみるさー！","zh":"那我就试着把“最喜欢家人了——”\n这种心情写下来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"add14a2a13b7b78189b2c5d88a31bbfe35415dd557c4d5f2c710a2ecde4a372e","ja":"へへっ、真っ向勝負って感じでいいね♪","zh":"嘿嘿，这种正面交锋的感觉真不错♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"3bed3fe1ead21ec53b4ec810fb85fe614b6c2c9cc83116761204a50594bf6133","ja":"ボクも、「カワイイが大好き」って気持ち、\n全力でぶつけに行くぞー！","zh":"我也要把“最喜欢可爱的事物”的心情，\n全力传达给大家——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"147322cecbc7412fb13ae7720c470f1cb992d7caa75bf8c9ec2178605149b0e3","ja":"ふふ……\nふたりともどんな歌詞ができるのか楽しみだわ。","zh":"呵呵……\n真期待你们两个人会写出怎样的歌词呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"9c8646704b9cd42f109a5e0605b8e0c77def60e22c9aadf24bdcf063d0323ca7","ja":"私も負けないように、\nもう一度、見直そうかしら♪","zh":"为了不输给其他人，\n我也再重新检查一遍吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1438.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"4496ae00bbf8ec146720d79085f0e81d243ef9cea0c40ab77d00adcc283a4d0d","ja":"そうですね。\nみんなで良い物を出せるように、心を込めて。","zh":"是啊。\n为了能和大家一起拿出优秀的作品，倾注心血吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
